  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Portfolio II",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eThis set of images begins where the \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-i/\"\u003elast portfolio\u003c/a\u003e\nleaves off and primarily shows my travels during the summer of 2017, with the\nlast image being the only one outside of that. I have again chosen to stick to\nblack and white images taken with my Hasselblad for consistency, and because\nit\u0026rsquo;s what I primarily use. I am planning on doing one of these with the colour\nphotos that I\u0026rsquo;ve taken since I started shooting square format.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eThis set of images begins where the \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-i/\"\u003elast portfolio\u003c/a\u003e\nleaves off and primarily shows my travels during the summer of 2017, with the\nlast image being the only one outside of that. I have again chosen to stick to\nblack and white images taken with my Hasselblad for consistency, and because\nit\u0026rsquo;s what I primarily use. I am planning on doing one of these with the colour\nphotos that I\u0026rsquo;ve taken since I started shooting square format.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4707/4707.avif\"\n         title=\"蒙自西路 West Mengzi Road\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e蒙自西路 West Mengzi Road\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4807/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4807/4807.avif\"\n         title=\"West Lake\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4807\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWest Lake\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4811/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4811/4811.avif\"\n         title=\"Great Wall\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4811\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eGreat Wall\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5101/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5101/5101.avif\"\n         title=\"Koishikawa Kōrakuen Garden\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"5101\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eKoishikawa Kōrakuen Garden\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5104/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5104/5104.avif\"\n         title=\"Tensouchi\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"5104\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTensouchi\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5305/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5305/5305.avif\"\n         title=\"Red Gum\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"5305\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eRed Gum\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5802/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5802/5802.avif\"\n         title=\"Tasman Island\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"5802\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTasman Island\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5805/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5805/5805.avif\"\n         title=\"Lake Gordon\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"5805\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eLake Gordon\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/5906/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/5906/5906.avif\"\n         title=\"Adelaide Palm House\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"5906\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eAdelaide Palm House\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6002/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6002/6002.avif\"\n         title=\"Escalators\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6002\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eEscalators\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6007/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6007/6007.avif\"\n         title=\"Ulsanbawi\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6007\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eUlsanbawi\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6609/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6609/6609.avif\"\n         title=\"Clifton Boulevard\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6609\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eClifton Boulevard\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll of these images were shot on Ilford HP5+, and all but the last one pushed to\nISO 800, which has become something of a default for me. Also, all \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-ii/#5805\"\u003ebut\none\u003c/a\u003e of these images were shot with the 150mm lens, which I bought in\nMarch of 2017 and also used for the last four images in \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-i/\"\u003ePortfolio\nI\u003c/a\u003e. I seem to use both of the lenses I own for my Hasselblad (the\n60mm and 150mm) pretty evenly but I find most of the images that I take that I\nreally like have been with the 150mm.\u003c/p\u003e",
